  (text "We scale to 3.5v before feeding into headphone amp \nas noise increases a bit in the MCP6281 above this range.\n\nWe could scale it even higher if we need \nsmaller DC filtering caps while maintaining 3hz cutoff. Would increase noise a bit; check out MCP datasheet.\n\nit's kinda gross to have pots on a different PCB, but oh well, think it's best for the user.\n\nhttps://www.desmos.com/calculator/1vo3jniijy" 
